    "answer": "A",
    "explanation_zh": "備忘錄開頭寫道「This is a memo to give you advance notice of my request」，且日期為1月5日，請求的假期從1月25日開始，顯示Mary是提前很早就提出請求。選項(A)「To make a request well ahead of time」符合此意。",
