    "passage": "Space for living\n\nASK A DESIGNER AT HOME DÉCOR EVENT\n\nCome and talk to HOME DÉCOR's design consultants. They'll answer your questions about\ninterior designing and give you tips on how to create beautiful rooms you will love. Brought to\nyou by Space For Living, HOME DÉCOR's Design Series.\n\n                          June 30                      1-3 p.m.\nHD Burlington             June 31                      1-3 p.m. & 6-8 p.m.\n\nHD Vaughn                 July 1                       1-3 p.m.\n                          July 3                       6-8 p.m.\n\nHD North York             July 2                       1-3 p.m. & 6-8 p.m.\n\nHD Markham                July 4                       1-3 p.m.\n                          July 5                       6-8 p.m.\n\nJoin us for this exciting event, and receive a special gift. Tickets are available at your local\nHOME DÉCOR store. For further details, visit HOMEDECOR.com",
