    "answer": "B",
    "explanation_zh": "信件結尾寫著「What do you think? Please get back to me today.」，表示Rupert Baker希望Mary Moore針對他所提出的時間表給予意見或回饋，因此正確答案為「To receive feedback on a proposal」。",
