    "passage": "April 25, 2010\n\nScenic Arts\nMr. Wayne Thomas\n12 Yorkshire Rd\nEngland\n\nDear Mr. Thomas,\n\nI am the president and founder of True Reproductions, a company specializing in the reproduction of fine art prints. We reproduce a wide range of diverse art but have been concentrating of late on incredible abstract art.\n\nOne of our photography experts, who is a huge fan of your work, recently introduced me to your \"Seven\" collection recently published in A Magazine. She was absolutely entranced by the series, and I was in agreement.\n\nWe would love to showcase some of your work in our upcoming publication, which is due to be produced later this year. We are compiling a thematic series of approximately 6-8 artists and would like to include you as well. This book will be a collector's item we hope!\n\nPlease let me know if you're interested in this idea. You would have a full section devoted to your work. We would be delighted to speak with you about all the specific details at your earliest convenience. Will be in touch at the end of next week to follow-up.\n\nYours sincerely,\n\nAmanda Young\n\nPresident, True Reproductions",
