    "difficulty": "B1",
    "vocabulary": [
      "advertise",
      "available",
      "bookstore"
    ],
    "passage": "Making It Big with only a Dollar a Day!\n\nNow let's be real. Life is much more complex today compared to the way things were 50 years ago. The introduction of personal computers in our homes and workplaces and the vast number of investments available in the market make our lives much more confusing. And with the world changing so fast, it's hard to keep up with the latest trends and new investment products that are made available by our local investment advisors or institutions. This means having to do your homework on learning about the constant, changing, investment opportunities and instruments on top of doing your daily household chores and work assignments. Completely overwhelmed and, exhausted, you're not alone. Hundreds of people , everyday face the same situation as you, but where do they turn to for help?\n\nNow the solution has become much easier with an investment of as little as 10 minutes and a dollar a day. Watch your savings grow from a small hill to a large mountain in no time at all. Making It Big with only a Dollar a Day! can put you on the right path to financial success and happiness. Read it, and you'll learn that working is good, but financial success is even better. At $29.99, you will get your money's worth. It's available at any local bookstores near you.",
