    "answer": "C",
    "explanation_zh": "這封信的主要目的是確認訂單。Lynn 在信中明確表示「I would like to confirm my order for this DVD player」，並提及之前嘗試線上購買但該型號無庫存，因此寫信確認訂單。選項 (C) 中的「verify an order」與「confirm my order」意思相符。",
    "skill_tag": "reading_main_idea",
    "difficulty": "B1",
    "vocabulary": [
      "confirm an order",
      "purchase",
      "availability"
    ],
    "passage": "To: sales@topelectronics.com\nFrom: Lynn@hotmail.com\nSubject: Purchase of DVD Player\n\nHello,\n\nI browsed your company's website and found the price of the DVD player listed very attractive. I am interested in the LG DVD Player LG6800. However, when I tried to purchase the item online, I realized that the item for this particular model is not available at the moment. I would like to confirm my order for this DVD player.\n\nIs it possible for your company to advise me on the availability date of this DVD player? Will it still be $180.00?\n\nAs for the shipping charges, it is written on the website that for all purchases above $80, there will be no shipping charges. Presumably that the cost of $180 includes shipping. Is there any shipping insurance coverage on the shipment? I had some bad experiences earlier this year with some e-commerce retailers. Many of the orders I received were in bad or damaged conditions. I want to ensure that the item is insured for this order, as it might get damaged or mishandled during transit.\n\nThank you!\n\nLynn",
    "passage_group_id": "p7-xd-9-312-176-177",
    "passage_group_type": "single",
